{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the Beach</strong> is a short, absurdist narrative experience where your one and only objective is clear: you have to escape the beach. You can expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >traversable beach environment with full day/night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >short story mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fully voiced narrator that guides you through the experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >many bizarre objects that appear on the beach, which could aid in your escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiple-choice questions with branching dialogue</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Wishlist the game to be notified when it releases!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/eaeb180a474d3814d942715819ca5044.poster.avif?t=1757073671\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/eaeb180a474d3814d942715819ca5044.webm?t=1757073671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/eaeb180a474d3814d942715819ca5044.mp4?t=1757073671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself on a quiet tropical beach. Before you is the vast ocean, behind you\u2014a lush forest. Guiding you under the scorching sun is a soothing but ominous voice, whose intentions you're not quite sure of yet. Is it going to help you leave the beach, or force you to wander endlessly along a serene landscape of water and sand?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/304884db1b4ce0e79739f038eb58ef99.poster.avif?t=1757073671\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/304884db1b4ce0e79739f038eb58ef99.webm?t=1757073671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/304884db1b4ce0e79739f038eb58ef99.mp4?t=1757073671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets of the beach and bask in its beauty, inquire about the out-of-place objects you find on it, listen to the blunt, sarcastic remarks of the narrator and try to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/ea527309de8e46c05c890e0ba6ed77a4.poster.avif?t=1757073671\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/ea527309de8e46c05c890e0ba6ed77a4.webm?t=1757073671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/ea527309de8e46c05c890e0ba6ed77a4.mp4?t=1757073671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3740000?t=1757073671","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3740000?t=1757073671","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/888d1bd07803bf830148b5aaae615be00c66dd4a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757073671","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/888d1bd07803bf830148b5aaae615be00c66dd4a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757073671","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Ste